    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages user-defined voice command macros. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Thread-safe. Macros are stored in memory; persistence to ThemisDB can be added via importMacros / exportMacros once the storage layer is wired up.</para>
<para>Trigger-phrase matching is case-insensitive and uses substring lookup: the user utterance is normalised to lower-case, and the registered phrase is treated as a sub-string that must appear in the utterance. </para>
